    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17335" root="زب" body-key="z">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تزبّب العِنَبُ</span></b>  <i>The grapes became converted
into</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَبِيب</span> [or <i>raisins</i>]. (Mgh, Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَزَبَّبَ قَبْلَ أَنْ يَتَحَصْرَمَ</span> (tropical:)  [expl. in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حصرم</span>].
(TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also 2, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تزبّب</span> also signifies <i>He</i> (a man) <i>became filled with
rage,</i> or <i>wrath.</i> (TA.)

